			<div class="content" id="post-content-1137719">
									

<blockquote>
<p>SCP-212 does not inject any anesthetic, or replace any blood lost. The process has been described as “excruciatingly painful”, and can result in the death of the subject at a rate of 47%.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>The “improvements” appear to be random, and can sometimes be detrimental or fatal, as illustrated by one subject’s complete loss of bone marrow and its replacement by a gel that is still under study.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Start with the screaming and proceed with the PTSD.</p>

